        </div>
        
        <h1 style="font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 40%, #cbd5e1 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; font-family: 'Inter', 'Hind Siliguri', sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px;">
            Node.js এর শক্তিতে <span style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9, #10b981); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;">Laravel-এর মতো Elegance</span>
        </h1>
        
        <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2.8rem; font-family: 'Hind Siliguri', sans-serif; font-weight: 400; max-width: 780px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
            NodeFlow হলো একটি আর্কিটেকচারালি রিচ Express MVC ফ্রেমওয়ার্ক। এতে অন্তর্নির্মিত রয়েছে Fluent Query Builder, Dual Auth (Session & Bearer Token), RBAC Gates, CLI Generators, Socket.io WebSockets, Queue Workers এবং Swagger OpenAPI specs!
        </p>

        <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.2rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <a href="/docs" class="btn btn-primary" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9 0%, #0284c7 100%); border: none; font-weight: 700; padding: 0.9rem 2.2rem; border-radius: 14px; font-size: 1rem; font-family: 'Inter', 'Hind Siliguri'; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.4); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; transition: transform 0.2s;">
                <i class="fas fa-book-open"></i> ডকুমেন্টেশন দেখুন
            </a>

            <a href="https://github.com/atifsoftware/NodeFlow" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline-light" style="background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); color: #f8fafc; font-weight: 600; padding: 0.9rem 2.2rem; border-radius: 14px; font-size: 1rem; font-family: 'Inter', 'Hind Siliguri'; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; backdrop-filter: blur(8px);">
